Hello pizza delivery enthusiasts!

Some bugfixes and additional content today! To celebrate the start of a sale we decided to share this patch.

As always, if you want to get in touch with your thoughts and suggestions, visit our [url=https://discord.gg/mV9mWMK]discord[/url].

Changelog (1.0.3):
- Fixed the resolution screen in the options menu - should correctly display the refresh rate now;
- Added quality preset setting in the options menu;
- Content update: World 1 hub area now includes an additional passageway in the lower part;
- New helmets! A selection of one more helmet style has been added;
- Fixed the World 2 helmets appearing in World 1 levels;
- Small sprite rendering and arrow pointing fixes in World 1 levels.

Thank you and happy delivering!
